# Staged eaon-cli payload (scripts/stage-cli.sh) — a full production build
# incl. node_modules, regenerated at release-build time, never committed.
# resources/eaon-cli/.gitkeep itself IS tracked (see that file) — Tauri
# hard-fails any build, dev included, if this directory doesn't exist at
# all, so the directory must survive even with nothing staged inside it.
